@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Vercel AI SDK preparation boundaries
+
+In this project, `supportAgent` uses `prepareCall`, so its effective instructions, output schema, and tool registry require evidence after call preparation. `stepSupportAgent` uses `prepareStep`; its output schema and tools remain statically attributable, but its effective instruction requires evidence after step preparation.
